<title>HONG KONG: Public Bank sets HK$1.0 bln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Public Bank sets HK$1.0 bln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger Sanwa International Finance.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PUBLIC BANK BERHAD</p>
<p> AMOUNT     HK$1.0 BLN  COUPON     3MH+25BP  MATURITY  3 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRCD	  ISS PRICE  PAR	 LAUNCH    05.MAY.97</p>
<p> PUTS	 NONE	  CALLS	NONE	REPLIES   21.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	  REPAYMENT  BULLET    DENOMS    HK$1 MLN</p>
<p> RATING     A2*	   SALE LMTS  STANDARD  TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> NEG PLG    --	    CRS DEF    --	  FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> HOME CTRY  MALAYSIA    GOV LAW    HONG KONG PAY DATE  --</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>   CO-LEAD MANAGERS    HK$100 MLN+    21BP   ALL-IN  32</p>
<p>   SENIOR MANAGERS     HK$70-90 MLN+  18BP   ALL-IN  31</p>
<p>   CO-MANAGERS	   HK$30-60 MLN   15BP   ALL-IN  30</p>
<p> ARRANGERS    CHASE MANHATTAN ASIA (BOOKS), HSBC MARKETS</p>
<p>		  (BOOKS), STANDARD CHARTERED BANK (BOOKS), SANWA</p>
<p>		  INTERNATIONAL FINANCE (PAY AGENT) AND</p>
<p>		  TOKYO-MITSUBISHI INTERNATIONAL.</p>
<p> NOTES	  *ISSUER IS RATED A2 BY MOODY'S INVESTORS SERVICE.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
